{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Macrolens: The Slimes</strong> simulates a camera\u2019s perspective watching a slime in a small garden corner. You can control the yellow slime, move around, and play mini-games to collect Earth Energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its cute visuals, the game can sit in the corner of your screen. It includes a Pomodoro timer, music player, and notes feature to help you relax and work more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold right-click to move the slime around the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/8295be9abff5440d0c4cf9d46eaadc5b.poster.avif?t=1767295302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/8295be9abff5440d0c4cf9d46eaadc5b.webm?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/8295be9abff5440d0c4cf9d46eaadc5b.mp4?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are plenty of fun little things to interact with in the scene</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/e003bf960f7b2e372d48025064f1cd4b.poster.avif?t=1767295302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/e003bf960f7b2e372d48025064f1cd4b.webm?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/e003bf960f7b2e372d48025064f1cd4b.mp4?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play cassette tapes in the game, or import your own .mp3 or .ogg files into the folder to play your own music.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/c7c83e946e97658eecf64f62a1839e8b.poster.avif?t=1767295302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/c7c83e946e97658eecf64f62a1839e8b.webm?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/c7c83e946e97658eecf64f62a1839e8b.mp4?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >One scene just for playing music and\u2026 letting everything sit there. Added a slider to adjust the time of day.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/3158431ce76a4e218d0d7859bc0efbea.poster.avif?t=1767295302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/3158431ce76a4e218d0d7859bc0efbea.webm?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/3158431ce76a4e218d0d7859bc0efbea.mp4?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can go fishing, but you\u2019ll have to wait a bit for a bite.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/abec82347e72b804e3cc2fb96aea681b.poster.avif?t=1767295302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/abec82347e72b804e3cc2fb96aea681b.webm?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/abec82347e72b804e3cc2fb96aea681b.mp4?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >How about testing your luck a bit? We\u2019ve got the Infuse Machine \u2014 you put in some orbs, and it can generate a new amount, either more or less. Give it a try, it\u2019s fun and pretty suspenseful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/86169f67b120205c5b3d3cec51e62878.poster.avif?t=1767295302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/86169f67b120205c5b3d3cec51e62878.webm?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/86169f67b120205c5b3d3cec51e62878.mp4?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you collect enough orbs, you can buy items and decorate your little yard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/fe10a47b45391199cc45345b7ec47d6a.poster.avif?t=1767295302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/fe10a47b45391199cc45345b7ec47d6a.webm?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/fe10a47b45391199cc45345b7ec47d6a.mp4?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4115690?t=1767295302","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/4115690?t=1767295302","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/e68ad33190301203e81c721ff7512eb72ba0bfed/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1767295302","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/e68ad33190301203e81c721ff7512eb72ba0bfed/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1767295302","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Macrolens: The Slimes</strong> simulates a camera\u2019s perspective watching a slime in a small garden corner. You can control the yellow slime, move around, and play mini-games to collect Earth Energy.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With its cute visuals, the game can sit in the corner of your screen. It includes a Pomodoro timer, music player, and notes feature to help you relax and work more efficiently.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hold right-click to move the slime around the scene.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loo