ng your luck a bit? We\u2019ve got the Infuse Machine \u2014 you put in some orbs, and it can generate a new amount, either more or less. Give it a try, it\u2019s fun and pretty suspenseful!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/86169f67b120205c5b3d3cec51e62878.poster.avif?t=1767295302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/86169f67b120205c5b3d3cec51e62878.webm?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/86169f67b120205c5b3d3cec51e62878.mp4?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you collect enough orbs, you can buy items and decorate your little yard.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/fe10a47b45391199cc45345b7ec47d6a.poster.avif?t=1767295302\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/fe10a47b45391199cc45345b7ec47d6a.webm?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4115690/extras/fe10a47b45391199cc45345b7ec47d6a.mp4?t=1767295302\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game is currently in development.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>","developers":["Lunaemon Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/st